---
// Lógica de servidor
---

<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>Solaire of Astora | Praise the Sun</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main class="hero-section">
			<video class="bg-video" autoplay loop muted playsinline>
				<source src="/hoguera.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
			</video>

			<div class="video-overlay"></div>

			<div class="hero-content">
				<h1 class="hero-title">Solaire de Astora</h1>
				<p class="hero-subtitle">
					El sol es un astro maravilloso. ¡Ojalá yo pudiera ser tan
					incandescente!
				</p>
				<a href="#pacto" class="cta-button">Únete al Pacto</a>
			</div>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	:root {
		--color-bg-dark: rgb(15, 15, 18);
		--color-sun-gold: #fdb813;
		--color-text-light: hsl(0, 0%, 85%);
		--color-sun-glow: rgba(253, 184, 19, 0.4);
	}

	body {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);
		color: var(--color-text-light);
		font-family:
			system-ui,
			-apple-system,
			sans-serif;
		overflow-x: hidden;
	}

	.hero-section {
		position: relative;
		/* ¡NUEVO! Crea un universo cerrado para que el video no se pierda detrás del body */
		isolation: isolate;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		height: 100vh;
		text-align: center;
		padding: 0 20px;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.bg-video {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
	}

	.video-overlay {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		background-color: rgba(15, 15, 18, 0.7);
		z-index: -1;
	}

	.hero-content {
		max-width: 800px;
		z-index: 1;
	}

	.hero-title {
		color: var(--color-sun-gold);
		font-size: 4rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 4px;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		text-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--color-sun-glow);
	}

	.hero-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.cta-button {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 15px 35px;
		background-color: transparent;
		color: var(--color-sun-gold);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		font-weight: bold;
		border: 2px solid var(--color-sun-gold);
		border-radius: 5px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.cta-button:hover {
		background-color: var(--color-sun-gold);
		color: var(--color-bg-dark);
		box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--color-sun-glow);
	}
</style>
